+Spec refs: REQ-REPORT-5455, SCENARIO-REPORT-5455-APPEND-DELTAS,
+SCENARIO-REPORT-5455-NO-NEW-DELTA,
+SCENARIO-REPORT-5455-BLOCKED-MISSING-PLANNER.
